I'll have 5 scenes in AdventureScene: Starting Space #0, Space #1, Space #2.1, Space #2.2, & Space #3. 
And I'll have 2 scenes not based in AdventureScene: The opening (or the game menu) and the end credits.
The methods I'll add to simplify repetitive aspects of my scenes is storing object parameters and preventing repetitive scenes. 
There will be multiple interactable objects in the game e.g. berries, desk, door, etc. 
All of the assets will be created by me - I'll mostly be using piskel. 
